Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Realizing the world no longer needed their “management,”\NSaskia and August chose to live peacefully on the Golden Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Saskia: All this time, I thought I was the one guiding you, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Saskia: You developed both your passion for alchemy\Nand your compassion for others all on your own...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Saskia: ...perhaps you never needed anyone\Nto guide you in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Saskia: I'll be watching over you all from the Golden Star\Nas you continue your journey with alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Resna: Yes. Thank you, Miss Saskia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With the World Gate connecting to other worlds now open,\Nthe wanderers would return home after things had settled down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayesha: When we return to our own worlds, our memories of this world will disappear, won’t they...? It's a little sad thinking about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shallistera: ...I’m worried about this world too,\Nbut I believe Resna and the others will be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.57,0:01:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Resna: Thank you...!\NI’ll keep doing everything I can from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Resna: I’ll never forget everything you’ve all done for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.19,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Palme withdrew into seclusion, the Nine were freed\Nfrom their duty of “management” and chose to live as they pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.89,0:01:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Held and Zero set off together. Jelka roamed as an adventurer,\Nwhile Citrine leisurely ran a handyperson business—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.03,0:01:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Gou and Liebe continued supporting Saskia and the others,\Nwhile Jadwiga and Quinn decided to try living among humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:02:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Held: Valeria, live however you wish.\NIf you ever miss your siblings, come see us anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Valeria: Yeah... got it! Until next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Criselda and the others, who had helped restore alchemy, had each found a new calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Criselda, Antje, and Walther began researching the star sea\Nto better understand the world—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They each pursued their paths—Lara working for her kingdom’s prosperity,\Nand Geron and Tim seeking to save those afflicted by curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.27,0:02:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lara: Criselda, everyone's found their way forward\Nhave you found yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.78,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Criselda: Mine? It's to stand alongside all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As the revival of alchemy spread across the world,\NKeiun ended its isolation and opened its borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.49,0:03:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaburaya, who had close ties with alchemists,\Nwas appointed to lead the newly established alchemy initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kimon and the others would remain at Kaburaya’s side,\Nsupporting her as she eagerly awaited the dawn of a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.57,0:03:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaburaya: The times may change... Yet this unchanging bond\Nwith all of you will always remain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaburaya: Most excellent! Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiny had believed that Guillaume’s voice, which she had heard while petrified,\Nwas nothing more than a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,However, when she learned that the other petrification victims\Nhad perceived their actual surroundings as if in a dream, she realized the voice had been real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiny: (Is Mr. Weird Mask really my brother, Guillaume...? But he keeps denying it...)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiny: (...He must have his reasons.\NUntil he chooses to tell me himself, I’ll—)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.41,0:03:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Els: Let’s go, Tiny. It’s time for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiny: Yes! Tiny Rompuy, reporting for duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,While journeying toward World’s End, Mowen heard rumors\Nin Oberland about a certain knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:04:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The man had appeared without warning and, ignoring the islanders’ advice,\Ntraveled beyond World’s End—to the very edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving behind the words, “I’ll be waiting there.”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mowen knew instinctively that the man was Julius—\Nthe husband she had been searching for all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mowen: I don’t know what dangers lie ahead...\NEven so, I have faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mowen: I’m on my way now to you.\NHang on, Julius—!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Star Vanguard set to resume operations,\NCreo trained day and night alongside its members as their captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.15,0:04:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Roman spent his days working tirelessly at the heart\Nof the alchemy restoration project alongside Brad, Resna, and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Brad: Richard, what will you do now?\NWill you continue your life as the adventurer Roman Kalman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.43,0:04:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Roman: For now, I’ll fulfill my duties as Prince Richard.\NBut Roman Kalman is here to stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.94,0:04:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Roman: Because as long as people live,\Nthey’ll always pursue romance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks in part to Rias and the others’ efforts, Hallfein’s reconstruction\Nprogressed smoothly, restoring the town to its former glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet the two still had one lingering concern—\Nthe people who had once called this town home—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Rias: ...With the power of alchemy,\Nmaybe one day Grandpa and the others will—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Slade: ...I can’t use alchemy,\Nbut I’ll keep supporting you however I can, Rias.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.71,0:05:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Rias: Thanks! With you by my side, Slade,\NI can charge ahead without a worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Rias: Just as I always have—and always will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Slade: ...Yeah. Let’s go as far as we can... together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,While working as a guide, Alvina traveled from place to place,\Nrepresenting the Archipelago Alliance’s alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bepp and Janne spent their days supporting Alvina\Nwhile diligently carrying out their duties as Sacred Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.47,0:06:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Though their days were incredibly busy,\Nall three seemed livelier than before they had set out on their journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bepp: Alvina, you’re so busy working as both a guide and an alchemist...\Nyet you look like you’re having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.09,0:06:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Alvina: Yeah, it’s so much fun!\NSure, being this busy is tough, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Alvina: Being a guide and an alchemist are both important to me.\NI’ll show you I can handle it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Alvina: I’ll guide everyone toward happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after their journey ended, Valeria’s memories never returned—\Nneither those of Nana, one of the Nine, nor those of the Valeria she once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But Valeria was content with that.\NEven without her memories, she has formed real bonds with Resna, Heidi, and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.39,0:06:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, Valeria returned home with the family she cherished—\Nthe family who accepted her for who she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.09,0:06:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Heidi: Hey, partner!\NFlocke’s got something delicious prepared for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:07:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Flocke: Welcome home!\NI got my hands on an exceptional fish today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Valeria: (Whatever my past may hold, I am who I am...\NAs for my present self, my home is right here.)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Valeria: I’m back!\NAnd... I’m starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As the Lantarna's representative alchemist,\NResna mentored those who aspired to follow the same path.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,By her side were two steadfast friends,\Nalways ready to support her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Johanna: It’s your day off, yet here you are doing alchemy again.\NWell, I suppose that’s just like you, Resna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Izana: Miss Resna!\NCan this problem be solved with alchemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Resna: Hehe. Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Resna: Resna the alchemist is on the case!
